:"/docs/reference/mcp","content":"The server's instructions to a client:"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-24","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp","content":"> Offline place data. Find places by name with `search`, by coordinates with `reverse` and `admin_at`, around a place with `nearby`; climb with `hierarchy` and descend with `children`. Places are named by IDs such as tgd:np/1xhb: pass them to `get_place`, `lookup`, `nearby`, `timezone` or read teigeodata://place/\\{id\\}. Coordinates are WGS84 degrees, distances metres, heights metres above EGM2008. A long answer has a `next_cursor`: call the same tool with only `cursor` for the next page. Show the `attribution` of an answer wherever its data is shown: the licences require it."},"1460":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-25","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"search · Search places by name","table":"table-0"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-26","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"reverse · Places nearest a point","table":"table-0"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-27","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"nearby · Places near a place","table":"table-0"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-28","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"get_place · A place by ID","table":"table-0"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-29","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"lookup · Places by IDs","table":"table-0"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-30","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/mcp#tools","content":"admin_at · Admin units at a point","table":"table-0"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/reference/mcp-31","page_id":"/docs/reference/mcp","tags"